{
  "id": "mega-evolution-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Mega Evolution Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Mega Evolution prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 13–14 and 20–21 September 2025, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Mega Evolution booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Mega Evolution logo. From this box on, each deck was built around a single promo's theme instead of two groups of cards. The decks also held non-holo copies of Meganium, Xerneas and Hariyama, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
